---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="找不到頁面" description="這個網址沒有對應的頁面。" noindex>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 text-center sm:px-6 sm:py-28">
    <p class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brick-600">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black text-navy-900 sm:text-4xl">找不到這個頁面</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-neutral-600">
      網址可能已更新，或這個頁面已經下架。你可以回到首頁，或看看最新的主日直播與週報。
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-navy-700 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-navy-600"
      >
        回到首頁
      </a>
      <a
        href="/media"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-navy-700 ring-1 ring-navy-200 transition-colors hover:bg-sand-100"
      >
        影音專區
      </a>
      <a
        href="/bulletins"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-navy-700 ring-1 ring-navy-200 transition-colors hover:bg-sand-100"
      >
        主日週報
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
